## C# Ignored Files

## Core Build Results (Ignore compiled outputs)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]/

## Visual Studio Cache, Settings, and User Files
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## MonoDevelop / Rider / Visual Studio Code Settings
.idea/
.vscode/
*.userprefs

## Package Manager Folders
packages/
# Exclude the paket directory if used, except the bootstrapper
.paket/
!*.paket/paket.bootstrapper.exe

## Operating System Files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

## Local Environment Secrets (Prevent leaking API keys)
usersecrets.json
appsettings.Development.json
*.secrets.json

